From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:38:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: mt6789: Make the TOPRGU a reset
 controller

The MT6789 watchdog exposes the WDT_SWSYSRST resets through mtk-wdt.
Add #reset-cells so consumers can reference them.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi
index cf276a7f..4d335531 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6789.dtsi
@@ -652,6 +652,7 @@
 			compatible = "mediatek,mt6789-wdt",
 			             "mediatek,mt6589-wdt";
 			reg = <0 0x10007000 0 0x100>;
+			#reset-cells = <1>;
 		};
 
 		mcusys: syscon@c530000 {
